{
  "action": "done",
  "why": "According to AMD-SUP-2026-02 and SOP-PUR-001 / SOP-PUR-005, a UN 38.3 certificate must remain valid for at least 60 days following the purchase order date (and have been issued within the preceding 12 months). From today (26 October 2026) to 15 December 2026 is only 50 days (less than the required 60 days), so it is not valid / not good enough for an order today, and buyers must enforce an order freeze when fewer than 60 days remain before expiry."
}

